{"id":"5cb0a9c6a08e31ed98bf082c4e90c406","name":"test_ws_poll_info_receives_terminal_status_from_worker_thread[True]","start":1794932669917,"stop":1794932670021,"duration":104,"status":"passed","fullName":"tests.unit_tests.test_bg_job_register#test_ws_poll_info_receives_terminal_status_from_worker_thread","retryHash":"3b8b4af1a7ac9dec8847283961634708.8ee89f01f3f42a039f3321f8d56d17b0","testCaseHash":"3b8b4af1a7ac9dec8847283961634708","parametersHash":"8ee89f01f3f42a039f3321f8d56d17b0","environmentHash":null,"flaky":false,"muted":false,"known":false,"isRetry":false,"labels":[{"name":"tag","value":"asyncio"},{"name":"parentSuite","value":"tests.unit_tests"},{"name":"suite","value":"test_bg_job_register"},{"name":"host","value":"runnervm8axu0"},{"name":"thread","value":"10384-MainThread"},{"name":"framework","value":"pytest"},{"name":"language","value":"cpython3"},{"name":"package","value":"tests.unit_tests.test_bg_job_register"}],"groupedLabels":{"tag":["asyncio"],"parentSuite":["tests.unit_tests"],"suite":["test_bg_job_register"],"host":["runnervm8axu0"],"thread":["10384-MainThread"],"framework":["pytest"],"language":["cpython3"],"package":["tests.unit_tests.test_bg_job_register"]},"parameters":[{"name":"from_threadpool","value":"True","hidden":false,"excluded":false,"masked":false}],"links":[],"steps":[{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"d82bd30bae9b76f78fe1fc9e20cd8fae","originalFileName":"3071b9d8-33c6-4633-9ce5-346fc2226d5f-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","contentType":"text/plain","contentLength":201,"name":"log"},"type":"attachment"}],"error":{},"testCase":{"id":"3b8b4af1a7ac9dec8847283961634708","externalId":"b26b2803a1572059e3c99b23587b1127","name":"test_ws_poll_info_receives_terminal_status_from_worker_thread[False]","fullName":"tests.unit_tests.test_bg_job_register#test_ws_poll_info_receives_terminal_status_from_worker_thread"},"descriptionHtml":"<p>A job finishing in its worker thread must wake the WS waiter in the main loop.</p>\n<pre><code>``run_command`` runs the job in a separate thread with its own event loop, but\nthe ``new_log_evt`` waiters live in the daemon loop. ``asyncio.Event.set()`` is\nnot thread-safe, so without hopping back onto the daemon loop the terminal DONE\nnotification is lost and ``ws_poll_info`` hangs forever (the desktop app's\n&quot;finalizing&quot; step never completes and the connection eventually drops).\n``from_threadpool`` mimics sync routes (``/update/start``), which call\n``run_command`` from FastAPI's threadpool, with no running loop.\n</code></pre>\n","environment":"default","setup":[{"id":"762969835a0b1b89cf66a0998923bced","type":"before","name":"event_loop_policy","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"56c5a914848e68183d232070e6af638d","type":"before","name":"tmp_path_factory","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"548c226dc43674f72854c553530e96de","type":"before","name":"monkeypatch","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"c1c48eb5828e035322e3f4b959a08e60","type":"before","name":"_isolated_hf_credentials","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"50a817cffa57ccfd459bd293e4dcbb0b","type":"before","name":"_no_telemetry","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"e69c2c4b146077ae2b789f9664837970","type":"before","name":"_function_scoped_runner","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"teardown":[{"id":"cda5e80811eba6c5076f7129e165e61d","type":"after","name":"_function_scoped_runner::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"c379af21c2e0e40be87471d55d14a2ba","type":"after","name":"monkeypatch::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"history":[],"retries":[],"breadcrumbs":[["tests.unit_tests","test_bg_job_register"]],"retry":false,"transition":"new","titlePath":["tests","unit_tests","test_bg_job_register.py"],"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"attachments":[{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"d82bd30bae9b76f78fe1fc9e20cd8fae","originalFileName":"3071b9d8-33c6-4633-9ce5-346fc2226d5f-attachment.txt